# SADA 3D — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Placeholders only: never commit real values.
# .env and .env.local are git-ignored; this file is the one exception.
#
#   LOCAL      needed for `npm run dev` to exercise the feature
#   VERCEL     set in Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   PROD       must be set for a production deployment to work correctly
#
# Nothing here is NEXT_PUBLIC_ except the site URL, so no secret is ever
# inlined into a browser bundle.

# ── Database — Supabase PostgreSQL ────────────────────────────────── LOCAL · VERCEL · PROD
# Accounts, orders, designs and the CMS all live here. Migrations need a
# session or direct connection (port 5432), not the transaction pooler (6543).
DATABASE_URL=postgres://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/postgres
DATABASE_POOL_MAX=5

# ── Payload CMS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── LOCAL · VERCEL · PROD
# Long random string. Without it admin sessions do not survive a restart.
PAYLOAD_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string

# ── Site ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── LOCAL · VERCEL · PROD
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Catalog ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── optional
# Set to `payload` once `npm run content:import` and `content:verify` pass.
# CATALOG_SOURCE=payload

# ── Payments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── optional
# Unset (or `mock`) uses the development adapter. No live provider exists yet.
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER=mock

# ── Cloudflare R2 — customer design storage (Stage 16) ─────────────── LOCAL · VERCEL · PROD
# A PRIVATE bucket and an API token scoped to it with Object Read & Write.
# Without these, uploads answer 503 and custom parts cannot be ordered; there
# is no local-disk fallback. Setup: src/lib/storage/README.md
# Check the real bucket with: npm run storage:verify
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your-32-character-cloudflare-account-id
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-access-key-id
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-secret-access-key
R2_BUCKET=sada3d-designs
# Optional. Derived from R2_ACCOUNT_ID when unset; required for an EU bucket.
# R2_ENDPOINT=https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com

# ── Development only ──────────────────────────────────────────────── optional, LOCAL
# SADA_DEV_ACCOUNT=0     sign the development customer out (production never has one)
# SADA_DEMO_ORDERS=1     seed demonstration orders in a production build (preview only)
